  organism — an autonomous system where intelligence IS the
  infrastructure. Key features include zero gas fees,
  873ms instant settlement, AI-first architecture with
  Phantom Intelligence Engine, real-time clearinghouse with
  multi-asset netting, 24 Latin-named production engines
  with 93 AI model instances, and universal token trading
  supporting crypto, AI tokens, AI artifacts, creator tokens,
  stablecoins, and real world assets. All system parameters
  are derived from the Golden Ratio (φ = 1.6180339887) and
  Schumann Resonance (7.83 Hz).
